{
    "title": "ZIIP Beauty",
    "description": "The ZIIP Beauty App connects you to everything ZIIP has to offer, whether you are using the OX, GX or the latest ZIIP HALO device. It was developed in-house using feedback from over 10 million electrical facial treatments since ZIIP\u2019s launch in 2015.\r\n \r\nTogether, with founder Melanie Simon's 20 years of professional expertise, and input from our community of ZIIP advocates - we bring you the ultimate collection of facials and treatments powered by ZIIP\u2019s unique Dual Waveform Technology.\r\n\r\nTo complement the LIFT treatment that is pre-programmed on every  ZIIP HALO, the ZIIP App offers a curated collection of full facials and targeted treatments, utilizing nanocurrent and microcurrent technology to give both immediate and lasting results.\r\n\r\nFull Facial Treatments:\r\nThe Lift\r\nProblem Solver\r\nElectric Tone\r\nInstant Gratification\r\nFounder\u2019s Favorite\r\n\r\nTargeted Treatments:\r\nContour\r\nPlump\r\nJowls\r\nBrow Lift\r\nEyes\r\nDe-Puff\r\n\r\nApp Extras:\r\nLearn Your HALO\r\n\r\nTreatment Plans:\r\nBest Skin of Your Life in 30 days\r\nEvent Prep\r\nNew to ZIIP \r\n\r\nMelanie Simon walks you through each treatment with easy-to-follow videos. Receive the latest new treatments, exclusive offers and insider promotions through app notifications. With an extensive FAQ section, everything you need to achieve your best skin is in the palm of your hand.",
